    "detailed_description": "In this survivor-like, roguelite experience you are a cell collecting food in the deep ocean. Use your abilities to fight for your life as more and more enemy cells close in on you. Evolve by collecting food, and gain upgrades that will make you and your abilities stronger.<br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A randomized experience: Every run is new and unique.<br></li><li>Unlock new abilities: Each ability will change your playstyle drastically.<br></li><li>Character customization: With unlockable skins and body parts, will you make your cell look fearsome, cute, or derpy?<br></li><li>Unique opponents: Enemies and bosses each have their own challenging attack patterns that you must learn to avoid in order to survive.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "In this survivor-like, roguelite experience you are a cell collecting food in the deep ocean. Use your abilities to fight for your life as more and more enemy cells close in on you. Evolve by collecting food, and gain upgrades that will make you and your abilities stronger.<br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A randomized experience: Every run is new and unique.<br></li><li>Unlock new abilities: Each ability will change your playstyle drastically.<br></li><li>Character customization: With unlockable skins and body parts, will you make your cell look fearsome, cute, or derpy?<br></li><li>Unique opponents: Enemies and bosses each have their own challenging attack patterns that you must learn to avoid in order to survive.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Collect food to evolve and fight for your life against enemy cells in this deep underwater, survivor-like, roguelite experience. Unlock parts to customize your character and become your own unique cell.",
